# Club & Grub - World 9, stage 2b in co-op: "Storm Nest" (designer D9a). The co-op file of levels/w9_l2b.lvl
# (DESIGN.md A.6 / B.5 / D.10, LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.7): the same approach and arena with P2's start; the co-op Storm
# Roc (hp 250 by itself): a wing shield toward the nearer active hero in phase 1 (a pincer on the nest), the Snatch
# in phase 2 (the partner frees a grabbed hero with a head hit within 73 ticks), Pilot and Spotter in phase 3 (a
# glider per hero on the nest; a dive counts only when a hero other than the pilot strikes the tumbling Roc's tail).

